8que :\n- Mangas\n- Webtoons\n- Bandes dessin\u00e9es\n- Comics\n\nModifiez l'environnement pour changer l'ambiance de vos lectures.\nUtilisez les contr\u00f4les Oculus Quest pour zoomer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cW-KWDHVdngQ7kNvwHcsvIM&_nc_oc=Adq7ZpiiOesUpMc_80gAQkaqPa2pqW8m7d6QHVvp4diy35dUZ5JKripKxkWv80VFMN8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS2vr7_j5Ff78gy6ExrYYnDFK4TbInCABto3qXYkoZX8w&oe=6B084EB4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hWtQbCVXbzsQ7kNvwHFciPj&_nc_oc=AdqUKP4QNXhvgz6iFFOOcOti1cRgqZP0fuWWAqG0JI5pKnLhHn0NjvZ4NyWvFdD55d8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRXljQm4NY4GMgSov0DfmIhLZsxrAZrm6c3LPSHscbejw&oe=6B085016"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=trmKuulQlscQ7kNvwEAGWWa&_nc_oc=Adod58cbEmkWxNPPCvf7U5z6igUkWNU8GU__FKWSGfvPuBC4X4kZ_